{
  "version": 1,
  "about": "mixamo-retarget M3 recipes (scripts/mocap/mixamoEmit.mjs): one per keyed Mixamo clip, by slug (PLAN.md 'Clip map'). kind gait | loop | timed; file = the FBX as downloaded; title = the site's title (the file without .fbx and any '(...)' note); target = the game state it is for; trim 'auto' (timed: the moving span, joint speed over the threshold, 0.1 s margin) or [s0, s1] seconds of the take; travel z | +x | -x | none; inPlace 'auto' (A4: hips travel under 5 cm) or true / false; gait = the planner band of a gait clip (walk); ownTrack keeps the capture's own track half; channels = the optional keyed channels written (head; clav / fing / fore are not emitted yet, M3-REPORT open items); studio = the Anim Studio row (mocapSources.ts MocapStudio keyed: body, move, crouch, circle; cycle is measured). (I7) file may be pack-<name>/<file>.fbx (the pack from the folder; the row title leads with the pack name); travel also -z (backward) or auto (the measured heading: the nearest axis, diagonals and arcs flagged in CLIPS.md); mirror true plays the take mirrored left <-> right; place game (default: src/anim/clips/mixamo/) or studio (Anim Studio only: src/anim/clips/mixamo/studio/); a gait row without move takes it from its travel (z fwd, +x side, -z back, -x none).",
  "clips": {
